{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "恳请闻思默向导演引荐  (Asking Wen Simo to Recommend an Actor)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Right after Wen Simo wraps a taping of his commentary show, Bu Xiaogu waits in the studio to ask a personal favor for the loyal travel-show actor. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "以上是今天闻娱论的全部内容，咱们下次节目再见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "刚才就看见你了，今天怎么过来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天有事请您帮忙，是私人拜托，荣思伦的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "之前去欧洲拍魅力远航的时候，星天整组的人都跟他成了朋友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他有一个孪生弟弟失踪了，他为了安慰养父母一直陪在那儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以最近好多好的机会他全都没有去拍，堂堂大明星都捉襟见肘了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这人倒挺重感情的，那怎么帮他呀？捐款哪？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "还真就您能帮他，有个戏叫倾城公主，您跟导演是老交情了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "能不能拜托闻老师引荐一下？荣思伦无论是演技还是颜值都胜任男一号。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "行，这个忙我倒是可以帮。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "但是你得准备一份有说服力的材料给我，不然我怎么跟导演开口啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您答应了？太谢谢闻老师了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "以上是今天闻娱论的全部内容，咱们下次节目再见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That wraps up all of today's entertainment commentary; see you on our next episode.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "刚才就看见你了，今天怎么过来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I spotted you just now; what brings you by the studio today?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天有事请您帮忙，是私人拜托，荣思伦的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I came to ask your help today as a personal favor regarding Rong Silun.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "之前去欧洲拍魅力远航的时候，星天整组的人都跟他成了朋友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When we filmed Charming Voyage overseas, the entire Xingtian crew became friends with him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他有一个孪生弟弟失踪了，他为了安慰养父母一直陪在那儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His twin brother went missing, and he stayed abroad to comfort the elderly adoptive parents.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以最近好多好的机会他全都没有去拍，堂堂大明星都捉襟见肘了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So lately he has passed up many great filming offers, leaving even a big star strapped for work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这人倒挺重感情的，那怎么帮他呀？捐款哪？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He really values personal loyalty; so how should we help him, with a donation?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "还真就您能帮他，有个戏叫倾城公主，您跟导演是老交情了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually only you can help him: there is a drama called Princess Qingcheng, and you are old friends with the director.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "能不能拜托闻老师引荐一下？荣思伦无论是演技还是颜值都胜任男一号。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could I ask Mr Wen to put in a word? Both his acting and screen presence are worthy of the male lead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "行，这个忙我倒是可以帮。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, that is a favor I can certainly help with.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "但是你得准备一份有说服力的材料给我，不然我怎么跟导演开口啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'However, you must prepare persuasive profile materials for me, or how can I bring it up with the director?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您答应了？太谢谢闻老师了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You agreed? Thank you so much, Mr Wen!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "以上是今天闻娱论的全部内容，咱们下次节目再见。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "刚才就看见你了，今天怎么过来了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天有事请您帮忙，是私人拜托，荣思伦的事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "之前去欧洲拍魅力远航的时候，星天整组的人都跟他成了朋友。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他有一个孪生弟弟失踪了，他为了安慰养父母一直陪在那儿。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以最近好多好的机会他全都没有去拍，堂堂大明星都捉襟见肘了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这人倒挺重感情的，那怎么帮他呀？捐款哪？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "还真就您能帮他，有个戏叫倾城公主，您跟导演是老交情了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "能不能拜托闻老师引荐一下？荣思伦无论是演技还是颜值都胜任男一号。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "行，这个忙我倒是可以帮。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "但是你得准备一份有说服力的材料给我，不然我怎么跟导演开口啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您答应了？太谢谢闻老师了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Moved by the actor's loyalty to his missing twin's elderly adoptive parents, Wen Simo agrees to introduce him to the drama director once Xiaogu prepares persuasive materials. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
